WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:20.923
Bird flew up to Kip's hole.

2
00:00:20.924 --> 00:00:26.465
"Are you okay?" asked Bird.

3
00:00:26.466 --> 00:00:34.664
"I was reading a scary book," said Kip.

4
00:00:34.665 --> 00:00:38.891
"It’s the middle of the night," said Bird.

5
00:00:38.892 --> 00:00:42.377
"Why are you awake?"

6
00:00:42.378 --> 00:00:46.689
"I'm staying up all night," said Kip.

7
00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:50.764
"Have fun," said Bird.

8
00:00:50.765 --> 00:00:56.817
"I'm going back to sleep."

9
00:00:56.818 --> 00:01:02.631
Bird flew down to her nest.

10
00:01:02.632 --> 00:01:09.916
She went to sleep.

11
00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:11.992
"Bird!" called Kip.

12
00:01:11.993 --> 00:01:14.856
"What?" asked Bird.

13
00:01:14.857 --> 00:01:17.825
"I'm still scared," said Kip.

14
00:01:17.826 --> 00:01:24.043
"That book was really scary."

15
00:01:24.044 --> 00:01:29.481
"There's nothing to be scared of," said Bird.

16
00:01:29.482 --> 00:01:33.290
"Can you stay up with me?" asked Kip.

17
00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:42.427
"No," said Bird. "I'm tired.

18
00:01:42.428 --> 00:01:45.082
Read a funny book.

19
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:56.876
Then you won't be scared."

20
00:01:56.877 --> 00:02:01.006
Bird went to sleep.

21
00:02:01.007 --> 00:02:13.137
Kip found a funny book.

22
00:02:13.138 --> 00:02:16.442
He sat down.

23
00:02:16.443 --> 00:02:22.422
He ate some popcorn.

24
00:02:22.423 --> 00:02:27.681
Kip opened the book.

25
00:02:27.682 --> 00:02:33.883
"Ha-ha!" Kip laughed. "Ha-ha!"

26
00:02:33.884 --> 00:02:41.756
Bird woke up again.
